 "video_principle": {
  "file": "useLocalShortVideo-Drins-0G.js (196,321 B)",
  "export": "Ea as r = 纯合成器 / Oa as t = Vue composable / Da as n = 转场表",
  "defaults": {
   "duration": 15,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 1280,
   "fps": 30,
   "bgmVolume": 0.6,
   "transformMode": "kenburns"
  },
  "pipeline": [
   "① 图片加载：new Image + crossOrigin=anonymous；失败走 co_util 的 PU_Request2(fetch,base64) 兜底（ha @191642）",
   "② 分段：aa(n,duration,0.18) → 每张图 start/end/transition，末段 transition=0（@189158）",
   "③ 逐帧绘制：ma() 每帧先 fillRect 黑底 → oa() 找当前段 → Ken Burns 用 da() 缓动缩放 1.0↔1.18 + 方向交替平移；fade/slide 用 fa() 双图叠 globalAlpha / translate（@189666/@191075）",
   "④ 出帧：canvas 交给 Vi(CanvasSource).add(timestamp,duration) → new VideoFrame(canvas,{timestamp,duration}) → VideoEncoder.encode（Vi @166012）",
   "⑤ 编码：codec=avc(H.264) → avc1.6400xx，alpha:discard，latencyMode/hardwareAcceleration 探测；BGM 走 AudioEncoder aac → mp4a.40.2（@17030/@18117/@101139）",
   "⑥ 音轨：OfflineAudioContext 解码 BGM → 按 duration 截断 → GainNode 应用 bgmVolume → AudioData 编码（va @192900）",
   "⑦ 封装：Mp4OutputFormat(Ji) + BufferTarget(Di, fastStart:in-memory) + Output(ia) → addVideoTrack(frameRate) / addAudioTrack → start → 逐帧 add → finalize → u.buffer（@125269/@177760/@180611）",
   "⑧ 出件：new Blob([buffer],{type:\"video/mp4\"}) + URL.createObjectURL → download()；AbortSignal 每帧检查，setTimeout(0) 每 5 帧让出主线程（Ea @193172-196099）"
  ],
  "concurrency": "批量发布并发 3（preview-Lhj8Bw4T.js @2400）",
  "limits": "MP4≤100M / 时长≤60s（建议30s内）/ 最少 600x600 / 1:1 3:4 9:16 / 每日发布上限100条",
  "three_sources": [
   "AI 视频：官方 submitImgOptimizeTask4PC + 每2s queryImgOptimizeTask4PC",
   "上传自定义：字节 VOD SDK upload_v1.js → OpenUploader.addFile/start 拿 Vid",
   "用主图视频：官方 uploadVideoToken → vod.bytedanceapi.com 取 MainPlayUrl+CoverUrl"
  ],
  "apply_to_product": "官方 /product/tproduct/batchSaveMaterial：material_type:23, is_direct_apply:true, video_type:main_video, code===0（co_util @481389）",
  "readback": "/material/videoTaskList?productIds= → videoList[].StatusStr（审核中/审核通过/审核失败）"
 }
